        "titolo_orig": "Man shot dead during protest against proposed US Ebola quarantine facility in Kenya",
        "testo_it": "Proteste in Kenya contro un centro di quarantena per Ebola gestito dagli Usa: un morto negli scontri.",
        "priorita": "Media",
        "id_gruppo": 11,
        "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jun/09/man-shot-during-protest-against-proposed-us-ebola-quarantine-facility-in-kenya",
